        "pageid": 76155525,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Himitsu no AiPri",
        "extract": "Himitsu no AiPri (ひみつのアイプリ, Himitsu no AiPuri) is a Japanese dress-up rhythm arcade game developed by syn Sophia and published by T-ARTS Company. It is the successor to Waccha PriMagi! and the fifth entry in Takara Tomy's Pretty Series. The series also introduces the AiPri Verse, the fifth generation in the Pretty Series known simply as AiPri.\nAn anime television series co-produced by OLM and DongWoo A&E began airing from April 7, 2024, to March 29, 2026, and consists of two seasons. It is followed by Onegai AiPri on April 5, 2026.\n\n",
